      <description>&lt;p&gt;this footage has been sitting on my computer untouched for literally three months for no reason so here&amp;rsquo;s a video for a song off of &lt;a href=&#34;https://peopleyoumeetoutsideofbars.bandcamp.com/album/the-only-thing-that-hurts-worse&#34;&gt;my RPM album&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Hbonvi01Pj0?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;i know you don&amp;rsquo;t want me to make myself small&#xA;you just wish there were a way i could not take up much room at all&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>visualiser: hello!</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/lyric-video-hello/</link>
      <pubDate>Sat, 04 Jan 2025 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/lyric-video-hello/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;today i made &amp;amp; released a lyric video visualiser type thing for the first song off of &lt;a href=&#34;https://gaygothvibes.online/blog/people-you-meet-outside-of-bars/new-ep-its-really-only&#34;&gt;my latest EP&lt;/a&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/MDMpiySAtA8?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;if you&amp;rsquo;d feel compelled to speak at my funeral&lt;br&gt;&#xA;consider this an open invitation to text my cell&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;sometimes all you need is a screen recording texting yourself, a projector your dad won in a raffle that is somehow still kicking over a decade later, &amp;amp; the last chunks of some cheap glitter eyeliner.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>EP: it&#39;s really only</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/its-really-only/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 31 Dec 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/its-really-only/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;embed video-player&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;iframe style=&#34;border: 0; width: 100%; height: 120px;&#34; src=&#34;https://bandcamp.com/EmbeddedPlayer/album=3893498687/size=large/bgcol=ffffff/linkcol=de270f/tracklist=false/artwork=small/transparent=true/&#34; height=&#34;240&#34; width=&#34;320&#34; seamless=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;december 29th was the twelfth anniversary of my &lt;a href=&#34;https://peopleyoumeetoutsideofbars.bandcamp.com/album/mind-like-an-oil-slick&#34;&gt;first album&lt;/a&gt; &amp;amp; the fifth anniversary of my (at the time) &lt;a href=&#34;https://peopleyoumeetoutsideofbars.bandcamp.com/album/too-much&#34;&gt;latest album&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;i’ve been working on an album. it isn’t done. there are a few songs that were going to be on it that i’d reluctantly decided didn’t flow or fit thematically &amp;amp; put back on the shelf to record later. then the double anniversary put my deeply into my feelings. some of these feelings were a deep annoyance at not having released anything this year as i’d planned to, so that day, i grabbed some of those songs off of that shelf &amp;amp; turned them into this EP.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>d204.10: ghosts</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/d204-ghosts/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 13 Sep 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/posts/people_you_meet_outside_of_bars/d204-ghosts/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;d204 is a project where i take a list of eighty songs that i wrote &amp;amp; record whichever one comes up when i roll a d20 &amp;amp; a d4&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/pymoob/d204_10_result.jpg#center&#34; alt=&#34;&#34;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;the-song&#34;&gt;the song&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div style=&#34;position: relative; padding-bottom: 56.25%; height: 0; overflow: hidden;&#34;&gt;&#xA;      &lt;iframe allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share; fullscreen&#34; loading=&#34;eager&#34; referrerpolicy=&#34;strict-origin-when-cross-origin&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube.com/embed/IfrxKMYtPAQI?autoplay=0&amp;amp;controls=1&amp;amp;end=0&amp;amp;loop=0&amp;amp;mute=0&amp;amp;start=0&#34; style=&#34;position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; border:0;&#34; title=&#34;YouTube video&#34;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;i breathe deep driving past graveyards&lt;br&gt;&#xA;’cause i’ve felt trapped &amp;amp; i bet when you’ve died&lt;br&gt;&#xA;lying with your body in the dirt is hard&lt;br&gt;&#xA;so i’m ok with giving a ride to anyone to anything to anyone&lt;br&gt;&#xA;brave enough to hop inside&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
